Z||000005||operator64||11-11-2001||01:28 PM||||   Yes those are Colorado tags. Well this car was on e-bay a while back and i was high bid on it for $520.00 and the last 5 seconds someone beat me out. Well the guy who beat me out was in Canada and i was told by the seller that the guy kept giving him the run around on the payment ( check is in the mail kinda thing ), so he told me he would sell it to me if the guy did not have the money to him on the day he said it should be there.<BR>   The seller let 2 more days pass after that day and then told me it was mine if i still wanted it.<BR>   History of the car, he owned it for about a year and a half, he bought it from a lady that had owned it for quite a while. It has new clutch, Battery, alternator, starter, plugs and wires, o2 sensor. I need to have a carfax done on it to gain more info on it if anyony could help me out with that i would be greatly appreciative.||||reg||1
